### SIPSA REST API — request collection
### Compatible with the IntelliJ HTTP Client and the VS Code REST Client extension.
### See http/README.md for how to set variables. Full endpoint docs: docs/api/sipsa-rest-api.md

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = {{accessToken}}
@apiKey = {{apiKey}}


### ============================================================
### Health
### ============================================================

### Health check (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health


### ============================================================
### Public query endpoints — GET /api/sipsa/**
### ============================================================

### List available public endpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sipsa

### Ciudad — city-level daily prices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sipsa/ciudad?ciudad=ARMENIA&startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-01-07&page=1&size=20&sort=fechaCaptura,desc
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Mayoristas mensual — monthly wholesale aggregates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sipsa/mayoristas/mensual?artiNombre=Bocadillo veleño&startDate=2023-01-01&endDate=2023-03-01
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Mayoristas semanal — weekly wholesale aggregates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sipsa/mayoristas/semanal?artiNombre=Kiwi&startDate=2025-05-01&endDate=2025-06-15
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Parcial — municipality market data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sipsa/parcial?muniId=05001&idArtiSemana=14&startDate=2020-01-01&endDate=2020-03-01
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Parcial — validation error example (blank muniId -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sipsa/parcial?muniId=
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Abastecimientos mensual — monthly supply data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sipsa/abastecimientos/mensual?artiNombre=Uchuva&startDate=2020-01-01&endDate=2020-06-01
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}


### ============================================================
### Internal ingestion endpoints — require Bearer token
### ============================================================

### List available ingestion methods (scope: sipsa/ingestion.read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/ingestion/methods
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Trigger a manual ingestion run (scope: sipsa/ingestion.execute)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/ingestion/run?method=promediosSipsaCiudad&force=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List currently active runs (scope: sipsa/ingestion.read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/ingestion/running
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List all runs, paginated (scope: sipsa/ingestion.read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/ingestion/runs?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get a specific run's status (scope: sipsa/ingestion.read)
### Replace {{runId}} with a runId from a previous response (e.g. the trigger response above).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/ingestion/runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel an active run (scope: sipsa/ingestion.cancel)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/ingestion/cancel/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Trigger without a token — expect 401 (scope-protected endpoint, no Authorization header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/ingestion/run?method=promediosSipsaCiudad


### ============================================================
### Internal audit endpoints — require Bearer token (scope: sipsa/audit.read)
### ============================================================

### Most recent audit events (last 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/audit/recent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### All audit events, paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/audit/all?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Audit trail for a specific request
### Replace {{requestId}} with a requestId from a trigger response.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/audit/request/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Audit events for a specific run
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/audit/run/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
